From 06968203e725a84f750b2ed56a2ec1129d033d11 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Demos Barpas <267039613+demosbarpas-hub@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:41:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sw: Add baseline JPEG encoder kernel (misc/jpeg)

Single-core baseline JPEG encoder (4:2:0, quality 50, standard Huffman
tables) using SSR/ISSR streams, FREP and the copift FPU-to-integer queues.
The DM core streams one 16x16 MCU at a time into TCDM and flushes the
compressed bitstream to `jpeg_out` after each MCU.

- datagen.py generates a deterministic synthetic RGB image (or loads an
  image file) and declares the `jpeg_out`/`jpeg_size` output buffers.
- verify.py compares the produced JFIF bitstream byte-for-byte with a
  Python golden model of the encoder arithmetic.

Developed as part of the diploma thesis "JPEG Compression on Low Power
RISC-V" (University of Patras, 2026).
